# C# metaprogramming in Unity
Using Roslyn Source Generators with Unity, you can mark fields with an attribute and have properties and events generated at compile time, delivered via a Unity analyzer assembly.

## SourceGenerator Implementation – template approach [¶](https://vij.app/blog/posts/c-meta-programming-with-unity/#sourcegenerator-implementation-template-approach)
```
using Microsoft.CodeAnalysis;
using Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.CSharp.Syntax;

[Generator]
public class SimpleSourceGenerator : ISourceGenerator
{
    public void Initialize(GeneratorInitializationContext context)
    {
    }

    public void Execute(GeneratorExecutionContext context)
    {
    }
}
```
